WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:02.535
TICKET CLERK: Deck 7,
departing in two minutes.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:04.037
JULES VAUGHN:
Thank you.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.709
♪ (SLOW MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.919
RUE BENNETT: Jules,
I just realized that
I didn't bring my medication.

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:24.190
JULES: We can get medication,
like, everywhere.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.225
RUE: Yeah, but I don't think
it's something that

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.761
I can, like, miss a day.
You know?

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:32.298
JULES: Rue, we'll figure it out.
I promise.

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:35.201
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:44.310
Jules, I don't-- I don't think
this is a good idea.

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:46.212
Rue, it was your idea!

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.947
I know-- I know it was my idea,
but I just--

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.115
I don't think it's a good idea
anymore.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.083
That's why I'm trying
to tell you.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.450
(CHUCKLES)
It was a fucking great idea.

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:52.485
I don't know
what you're talking about.

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:53.986
Can you slow down
'cause I'm thinking,

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:55.021
you know, my mom.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.390
I don't want her
to fucking freak out, all right.
I don't want to do it.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:01.127
Rue, it's not that far and,
like, we're good.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.227
We can-- we can call.

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:03.529
What am I gonna tell Gia though?

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:05.631
Like, she's gonna wake up
in the fucking morning.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:06.733
She's gonna think I'm missing.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.270
We're good. Come on.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:12.472
It's gonna be amazing.

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:15.842
Rue!

00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:23.817
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.722
(VOICE CRACKING) Come on.

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:38.698
Please come.

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.500
I love you.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.206
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

